      {"t":"type","p":"Are you a teacher?","a":["你 是 老师 吗","您 是 老师 吗","nǐ shì lǎoshī ma","nín shì lǎoshī ma"],"hint":"是 · 老师 · 吗","x":["呢"],"why":"Add 吗 to the statement to ask a yes/no question.","xr":["ne"]}
